  "rationale": "The added columns supply the two axes the query centers on (issue_type and assigned_agent) plus several plausible resolution-time drivers (resolver_matches_assignee, failure_mode, severity). Values are consistently sound readings of short_description and original assignment fields, with no clear hallucinations—only mild over-reads on generic descriptions. Usefulness is moderated because assigned_agent restates original assigned_to, and affected_system largely duplicates issue_type; failure_mode and severity partially overlap. Per the scope rule, no penalty applied for completeness."
